    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This memo defines a Relay Agent Echo Request option for the Dynamic
Host Configuration Protocol for IPv6 (DHCPv6).  The option allows a
DHCPv6 relay agent to request a list of relay agent options that the
server echoes back to the relay agent.</t>
    </abstract>
